{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_the_prototype_chain_how_lookup_walks_prototype_chain", "label": "Prototype chain lookup", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/the-prototype-chain/how-lookup-walks.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Walk own then each [[Prototype]] until a match or null. A miss is the most expensive lookup. Nothing is copied onto instances. Array methods live on Array.prototype, not the array."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_the_prototype_chain_how_lookup_walks_property_shadowing", "label": "Property shadowing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/the-prototype-chain/how-lookup-walks.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The first own match hides the further one. The prototype value is untouched and still reachable via Object.getPrototypeOf(o).b."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_the_prototype_chain_how_lookup_walks_internal_slot", "label": "[[Prototype]] internal slot", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/the-prototype-chain/how-lookup-walks.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not a property. Read with Object.getPrototypeOf. obj.__proto__ is a deprecated accessor inherited from Object.prototype, so it is absent on null-prototype objects."}], "edges": [{"source": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_the_prototype_chain_how_lookup_walks_prototype_chain", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_the_prototype_c